<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, background: '#0A1120', padding: '56px 72px', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 14, height: 76 }}>
        <Box style={{ width: 6, height: 32, background: '#2563EB', borderRadius: 3 }} />
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 40, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#E8EEF7' }}>它是什么：可编程干涉仪网格 = 量子处理器</Text>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, flex: 1, paddingTop: 8, paddingBottom: 8 }}>
        <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'column', gap: 18, justifyContent: 'center', width: 570 }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#E8EEF7', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>线性光学中，N 个模式的任意酉变换 U 由无源分束器 + 相移器实现。</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 20, color: '#E8EEF7', lineHeight: 1.75 }}>任意 N×N 酉可分解为 N(N−1)/2 片 2 模门——这是 Clements 必要性定理给定的数量，省不掉。</Text>
            <Box style={{ background: 'rgba(37,99,235,0.12)', borderRadius: 10, padding: '18px 22px' }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#2563EB', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>换一组相位即换一个酉，硬件不动。</Text>
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#9FB3CC', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>每片 MZI = 一个分束器 θ + 一个相移器 φ（2 个可编程参数）；同层配对互不共享波导，同层可同步。</Text>
        </Box>

        <Box style={{ width: 520, background: 'rgba(255,255,255,0.04)', borderRadius: 14, padding: 24, flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'space-between' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 17, color: '#9FB3CC' }}>MZI 网格（示意 · 交错错位 ⇒ 每层真匹配）</Text>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, height: 44 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#3A5A80' }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 68, height: 42, background: 'rgba(37,99,235,0.35)', border: '1px solid #2563EB', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#3A5A80' }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, height: 44 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#3A5A80' }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 68, height: 42, background: 'rgba(37,99,235,0.35)', border: '1px solid #2563EB', borderRadius: 6, marginLeft: 92 }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#3A5A80' }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, height: 44 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#3A5A80' }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 68, height: 42, background: 'rgba(37,99,235,0.35)', border: '1px solid #2563EB', borderRadius: 6 }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#3A5A80' }} />
            </Box>
            <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', gap: 8, height: 44 }}>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#3A5A80' }} />
                <Box style={{ width: 68, height: 42, background: 'rgba(37,99,235,0.35)', border: '1px solid #2563EB', borderRadius: 6, marginLeft: 92 }} />
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, height: 2, background: '#3A5A80' }} />
            </Box>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9FB3CC' }}>矩形 Clements 网格 · 深度 = N</Text>
        </Box>
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', alignItems: 'center', justifyContent: 'space-between', borderTop: '1px solid rgba(159,179,204,0.25)', paddingTop: 14 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#9FB3CC' }}>LDA · 光量子计算芯片（量子征程「吃狗粮」）</Text>
